<is-land on:visible><div id="comp-91dcde80-61f5-4c88-b6bb-920e374cf0f8" class="AccordionGroup" data-component-type="AccordionGroup"><div class="de-accordion-group bg-white theme-light"><div class="section-heading mb-4 container text-start" data-ste-element="Sites: Section Heading"><div><div class="row text-start"><div class="col col-md-8"><h2 class="header-focus"><span>Frequently asked questions</span></h2></div></div></div></div><div class="container"><div id="4XtS6vQr43DwgAnUeSzm8Z" class="de-accordion scroll-anchor"><h3 class="de-accordion__header"><button type="button" class="de-accordion__toggle" data-ste-element="accordion-header-what-is-low-voltage-condition-monitoring-with-sentron-and-how-does-it-enhance-energy-monitoring?" id="accordion-toggle-4XtS6vQr43DwgAnUeSzm8Z" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-4XtS6vQr43DwgAnUeSzm8Z" tabindex="0"><span class="de-accordion__focus-target"><span class="de-accordion__title">What is low-voltage condition monitoring with SENTRON and how does it enhance energy monitoring?</span><span class="de-accordion__icon"><svg class="icon icon-normal" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-plus"></use></svg></span></span></button></h3><div class="de-accordion__body" data-ste-element="accordion-body-what-is-low-voltage-condition-monitoring-with-sentron-and-how-does-it-enhance-energy-monitoring?" hidden="" id="accordion-content-4XtS6vQr43DwgAnUeSzm8Z" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-toggle-4XtS6vQr43DwgAnUeSzm8Z" aria-hidden="true"><div class="de-accordion-group__content de-accordion-group__content-article"><div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="twoColumnArticleTheme"><div class="text-start container multitextblock two-column-article"><div class="m-t-xl two-column-article-content layout-1-to-1 two-layout-top-alignment"><div class="p-lg-r-lg"><div><p>Low-voltage condition monitoring with SENTRON is a digital ecosystem that extends the value of SENTRON measuring devices by transforming collected measurement data into actionable insights – enabling timely maintenance before failures occur, without replacing functional components too early. </p><p>Whether used for an entry-level monitoring setup or advanced energy management, SENTRON low-voltage condition monitoring helps organizations operate electrical systems more efficiently, sustainably, and securely.</p><p><a href="/en-us/content/low-voltage-conditon-monitoring/">Learn more about condition monitoring with SENTRON</a></p></div></div><div><div><div class="mb-4"><img src="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/5kwH4vGKXaJIircQdh8xPq/en-US/energy-and-condition-monitoring-key-visual-mhero-1280x720.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=1280&amp;h=720&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60" alt="Using a laptop with two monitors, a woman views data and charts." style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="48FwS38FHjard1Q9Np0XPM" class="de-accordion scroll-anchor"><h3 class="de-accordion__header"><button type="button" class="de-accordion__toggle" data-ste-element="accordion-header-what-is-sentron-powerconfig-and-what-is-it-used-for?" id="accordion-toggle-48FwS38FHjard1Q9Np0XPM" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-48FwS38FHjard1Q9Np0XPM" tabindex="0"><span class="de-accordion__focus-target"><span class="de-accordion__title">What is SENTRON Powerconfig and what is it used for?</span><span class="de-accordion__icon"><svg class="icon icon-normal" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-plus"></use></svg></span></span></button></h3><div class="de-accordion__body" data-ste-element="accordion-body-what-is-sentron-powerconfig-and-what-is-it-used-for?" hidden="" id="accordion-content-48FwS38FHjard1Q9Np0XPM" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-toggle-48FwS38FHjard1Q9Np0XPM" aria-hidden="true"><div class="de-accordion-group__content de-accordion-group__content-article"><div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="twoColumnArticleTheme"><div class="text-start container multitextblock two-column-article"><div class="m-t-xl two-column-article-content layout-1-to-1 two-layout-top-alignment"><div class="p-lg-r-lg"><div><p>SENTRON Powerconfig is a PC-based commissioning software designed for communication-capable devices within the SENTRON portfolio. It simplifies device setup and significantly reduces configuration time, especially when multiple devices must be parameterized.</p><p><a href="https://sieportal.siemens.com/en-ww/products-services/10121795?tree=CatalogTree">Learn more about SENTRON Powerconfig</a></p></div></div><div><div><div class="mb-4"><img src="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/5DNHwz4C4sLyCJVaTi45Na/en-US/sentron-ecpd-highlight-Adaptability-Powerconfig-feature-640x360.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=1280&amp;h=720&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60" alt="sentron-ecpd-highlight-Adaptability-Powerconfig-feature-640x360" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="5H04cennS8lqVlOO1YQQI" class="de-accordion scroll-anchor"><h3 class="de-accordion__header"><button type="button" class="de-accordion__toggle" data-ste-element="accordion-header-how-does-power-distribution-integrate-into-the-tia-portal?" id="accordion-toggle-5H04cennS8lqVlOO1YQQI" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="accordion-content-5H04cennS8lqVlOO1YQQI" tabindex="0"><span class="de-accordion__focus-target"><span class="de-accordion__title">How does power distribution integrate into the TIA Portal?</span><span class="de-accordion__icon"><svg class="icon icon-normal" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#icon-plus"></use></svg></span></span></button></h3><div class="de-accordion__body" data-ste-element="accordion-body-how-does-power-distribution-integrate-into-the-tia-portal?" hidden="" id="accordion-content-5H04cennS8lqVlOO1YQQI" role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-toggle-5H04cennS8lqVlOO1YQQI" aria-hidden="true"><div class="de-accordion-group__content de-accordion-group__content-article"><div class="columnArticleClass two-layout-bg-white" id="twoColumnArticleTheme"><div class="text-start container multitextblock two-column-article"><div class="m-t-xl two-column-article-content layout-1-to-1 two-layout-top-alignment"><div class="p-lg-r-lg"><div><p>Power distribution can be seamlessly integrated into automation engineering through the TIA Portal by connecting SENTRON measuring devices directly to the Totally Integrated Automation environment.</p><p>By integrating SENTRON measuring devices into the TIA Portal, users can: </p><ul><li>Access energy and diagnostics data within one unified engineering framework </li><li>Parameterize and commission devices centrally and intuitively </li><li>Collect energy data directly alongside automation data </li><li>Synchronize electrical power distribution with machine and process operations </li></ul><p>This integration enables greater transparency, simplified engineering workflows, and optimized coordination between electrification and automation systems.</p><p><a href="https://www.siemens.com/en-us/products/tia-portal/">Learn more about TIA Portal</a></p></div></div><div><div><div class="mb-4"><img src="https://images.sw.cdn.siemens.com/siemens-disw-assets/public/7kQu4k2EkTFl2SoLGch7ig/en-US/97179bdb5be76f8d09132d03a1f05e89311ba2c8-7231-tia-portal-lv-visual-mindsphere-teaser-1920x1080.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;w=1280&amp;h=720&amp;fit=crop&amp;crop=faces%2Cedges&amp;q=60" alt="97179bdb5be76f8d09132d03a1f05e89311ba2c8-7231-tia-portal-lv-visual-mindsphere-teaser-1920x1080" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:16/9" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><template data-island><script type="module" src="/shared-assets/1f5459c4589ce8f899743c2f1031e839981f40d9/lib/helpers/esm/index.module.js"></sc